(2, '{\"en\":\"Terms of Service\",\"ar\":\"\\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629\"}', '{\"en\":\"1. Acceptance of Terms\\r\\n\\r\\nBy accessing or using Mazadat, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the platform.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. Platform Description\\r\\n\\r\\nMazadat is an online marketplace for livestock auctions, primarily focused on sheep trading. We act as an intermediary between buyers and sellers and are not directly involved in transactions unless stated otherwise.\\r\\n\\r\\n3. User Accounts\\r\\nUsers must provide accurate and complete information.\\r\\nYou are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account.\\r\\nMazadat reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.\\r\\n4. Listings and Auctions\\r\\nSellers are responsible for the accuracy of livestock descriptions, including health, breed, age, and condition.\\r\\nBuyers must review all details before placing bids.\\r\\nAll bids are binding. Once a bid is placed, it cannot be withdrawn except in exceptional cases.\\r\\n5. Payments and Transactions\\r\\nPayment terms are agreed upon between buyer and seller unless Mazadat provides integrated payment services.\\r\\nMazadat is not responsible for disputes related to payment delays or failures unless handled through the platform.\\r\\n6. Prohibited Activities\\r\\n\\r\\nUsers agree not to:\\r\\n\\r\\nPost false or misleading information\\r\\nEngage in fraudulent bidding or price manipulation\\r\\nViolate local laws or regulations related to livestock trading\\r\\n7. Liability Disclaimer\\r\\n\\r\\nMazadat is not responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\nThe quality, health, or condition of livestock\\r\\nAny losses or damages arising from transactions between users\\r\\nDelays, cancellations, or disputes between buyers and sellers\\r\\n8. Termination\\r\\n\\r\\nWe reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to the platform at any time fo